This project is published for **educational and preservation purposes**.

## Engine

The core engine code (C++) is a reimplementation of the Bermuda Syndrome engine,
reverse-engineered by **Gregory Montoir** and published at [github.com/cyxx/bermuda](https://github.com/cyxx/bermuda).

The upstream repository has been archived and does not specify a license.
All engine code remains the work of its original author.

## Android Port

The Android-specific additions (Kotlin/Java UI, touch overlay, SVG icon system, SAF importer,
Gradle build system) are provided as-is for educational use. These additions may be freely
studied, modified, and redistributed for non-commercial preservation purposes.

## Game Data Files

**No Bermuda Syndrome game data files are included in this repository.**

Bermuda Syndrome (1995) is copyrighted by Century Interactive / BMG. You must own
a licensed copy of the game to use this software.

